1791. Find Center of Star Graph

Description:
Given a star graph represented by an array edges, find the center node that is connected to every other node.

Test Case:

Input:  edges = [[1,2],[2,3],[4,2]]
Output: 2

Why?

Node 2 appears in every edge, so it is connected to all other nodes. Therefore, the center is 2.

class Solution {
    public int findCenter(int[][] edges) {
        if(edges[0][0]==edges[1][0] || edges[0][0] == edges[1][1]){
            return edges[0][0];
        }
        return edges[0][1];
    }
}
